Kron4ek prebuilt vanilla Wine 11.14, monolithic bin/lib/share tree. The
x86_64-windows/unix dirs hold the 32-bit Windows side (new WoW64), so no
32-bit Unix libraries are needed. Glibc-32 is listed only defensively for
third-party Windows apps that drop 32-bit PE bits outside Wine's dirs.
